{"id":"nbe6c9f7d4d","headline":"India's crude basket sees sharp shift in November as Brent share falls to 53.49%, Oman Dubai gains - BusinessToday","summary":"According to PPAC data released November 17, Brent Dated's share in India's crude basket fell 11.78 percentage points in November to 53.49%. Oman and Dubai gained by an equal margin.","why":"India is one of the world's largest crude oil importers, so the mix of grades it buys shapes global crude demand and regional pricing. Shifts between Brent and Middle East benchmarks affect refiners' costs.","category":"commodities","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/economy/story/indias-crude-basket-sees-sharp-shift-in-november-as-brent-share-falls-to-53-49-oman-dubai-gains-567820-2026-11-17"},"sources":[{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/economy/story/indias-crude-basket-sees-sharp-shift-in-november-as-brent-share-falls-to-53-49-oman-dubai-gains-567820-2026-11-17"}],"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:16:20Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T08:41:28Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"8266350e8a3e1378","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T08:41:28Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-11-17T07:16:20Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-11-17T08:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AE","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-5292067.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"661512","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/phot